      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-02-2018-june/q2",
      "question": "<p>Relative to a fixed origin <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span>,</p><p>the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> has position vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j-4\\mathbf k)\"></span>,</p><p>the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\"></span> has position vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4\\mathbf i-2\\mathbf j+3\\mathbf k)\"></span>,</p><p>and the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> has position vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(a\\mathbf i+5\\mathbf j-2\\mathbf k)\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> is a constant and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a&lt;0\"></span></p><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"D\"></span> is the point such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\overrightarrow{BD}\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find the position vector of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"D\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol><p>Given <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left|\\overrightarrow{AC}\\right|=4\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol>",
